    "Food and beverage businesses accounted for $37.5 million in visitor spending.",
    "These statistics cover Laurens County as a whole, rather than Dublin's city limits alone.",
    "They provide a useful indication of how visitors support the region's restaurants, hotels, shops and service businesses.",
    "They also help explain the economic importance of maintaining attractions and events that encourage people to spend time in the area.",
    "A downtown restaurant may benefit from a festival weekend. A hotel may serve families visiting relatives or travelers attending a community event. Small retailers may gain customers who originally came to see a historic landmark or attend a performance.",
    "Those individual transactions contribute to a visitor economy that supports employment throughout the county.",
    "## The Carl Vinson VA Medical Center Gives Dublin a Regional Role",
    "Dublin is also home to the Carl Vinson VA Medical Center, an institution that has served veterans since 1948.",
    "The medical center provides services including primary care, mental health treatment, rehabilitation and specialized medical programs.",
    "It also maintains educational relationships with colleges and universities, supporting training across multiple healthcare professions.",
    "The facility brings veterans, healthcare workers and students to Dublin from communities throughout the region.",
    "Its importance extends beyond employment and medical services. For veterans and their families, having access to care within the region can make a meaningful difference in the time and distance required to obtain treatment.",
    "The medical center is one of several institutions that give Dublin responsibilities and connections beyond its municipal boundaries.",
    "## Development Beyond the Business District",
    "Dublin's planning efforts have also addressed neighborhood conditions, public facilities and historic preservation.",
